  "prefLabel": "He-W 575.09 Third Party Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 575.09 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed in accordance with 42 CFR 433.129.\n\nSource. #10636, eff 7-12-14",
